{
  "resourceType": "Questionnaire",
  "id": "adverse-event",
  "url": "https://medplum.player.ohs.dev/fhir/Questionnaire/adverse-event",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "name": "AdverseEventFollowingImmunization",
  "title": "Report adverse event",
  "status": "active",
  "date": "2026-09-21",
  "subjectType": [
    "Patient"
  ],
  "_comment": [
    "AEFI report, scoped to the clinical core of a WHO AEFI investigation.",
    "",
    "The full WHO form is a 5-step investigation: vaccine lot and expiry, diluent and",
    "its manufacturer, injection technique and site, hospitalisation and discharge dates, past",
    "reaction history, and the investigating officer's own details. That is a national",
    "pharmacovigilance instrument filled in by an investigator after the fact. This form is the",
    "part a facility records at the point of care: which dose, what happened, how bad, and how it",
    "ended. The rest is deliberately out of scope.",
    "",
    "Everything here is base R4 -- no extensions. severity, seriousness and outcome use FHIR's",
    "own AdverseEvent code systems. The reaction is free text in AdverseEvent.event.text because",
    "R4 defines no code system for AEFI manifestations, and inventing one would be worse than",
    "saying it in words.",
    "",
    "The vaccine question has NO answerOption here on purpose: QuestionnaireService fills it at",
    "launch with the doses this child actually received, so suspectEntity points at a real",
    "Immunization rather than at a vaccine name."
  ],
  "extension": [
    {
      "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/sdc/StructureDefinition/sdc-questionnaire-extractAllocateId",
      "valueString": "aefiId"
    },
    {
      "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/sdc/StructureDefinition/sdc-questionnaire-templateExtract",
      "extension": [
        {
          "url": "template",
          "valueReference": {
            "reference": "#aefi-template"
          }
        },
        {
          "url": "resourceId",
          "valueString": "%aefiId.replace('urn:uuid:', '')"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
